{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/6e34c28be804c50ea559c70757d08725.avif?t=1764394131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras_big/6e34c28be804c50ea559c70757d08725.avif?t=1764394131 width=800 height=369 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel Judgment is a <strong>roguelike movement shooter\u00a0all about expressive and chaotic combat!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacle Fighter + Roguelike chaos inspired by <strong>ULTRAKILL</strong> and <strong>Risk of Rain 2</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mow down waves of enemies</strong> <strong>in a series of arenas while</strong> <strong>collecting upgrades and weapons</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense combat with many systems and synergies to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick and action-packed runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the Scourge and save your realm from their tyranny!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Venture through the realms and tear through your enemies</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted zones filled with distinct enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights inspired by character-action &amp; fighting games. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/ccb048cd77612aee9415c58249ae3e89.poster.avif?t=1764394131\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/ccb048cd77612aee9415c58249ae3e89.webm?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/ccb048cd77612aee9415c58249ae3e89.mp4?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Discover and master unique weapons and items</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide arsenal of weapons with creative mechanics and synergies to play around with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrade items with distinct effects that can be stacked and synergized to <strong>break the game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5b6ba68485d0b6e4002bbcb2322ee5f9.poster.avif?t=1764394131\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5b6ba68485d0b6e4002bbcb2322ee5f9.webm?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5b6ba68485d0b6e4002bbcb2322ee5f9.mp4?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Steal enemy abilities and perform combos</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal your enemies' souls</strong>\u00a0to copy their moves, and use them together with your weapons to create combos!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.poster.avif?t=1764394131\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.webm?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.mp4?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Unleash hell with a diverse and versatile moveset</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a wide range of fun movement options like <strong>uppercuts</strong>, <strong>air dashing</strong>, <strong>wall running</strong> and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.poster.avif?t=1764394131\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.webm?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.mp4?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Strength in numbers your enemies may have, but a legion of prey is no match for your might. All who stand in your path shall face Steel Judgment!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/9ad480b649d468c47ca52cdbc973d21d.poster.avif?t=1764394131\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/9ad480b649d468c47ca52cdbc973d21d.webm?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/9ad480b649d468c47ca52cdbc973d21d.mp4?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.a