m combos</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal your enemies' souls</strong>\u00a0to copy their moves, and use them together with your weapons to create combos!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.poster.avif?t=1764394131\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.webm?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/5864596618b38806bd08690f2f43507c.mp4?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Unleash hell with a diverse and versatile moveset</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a wide range of fun movement options like <strong>uppercuts</strong>, <strong>air dashing</strong>, <strong>wall running</strong> and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.poster.avif?t=1764394131\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.webm?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394690/extras/aabb2fcd5ce9a1d83fca201783a14b65.mp4?t=1764394131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Strength in numbers your enemies may have, but a legion of prey is no match for your might. All who stand in yo